            OUTPUT_ACCORDING_LINE_2 = 1 { name = "Output According Line 2"; desc = "output according to the line active pixel width in BT.470 mode When this bit is set to 0, the active width of the line is 720 pixels. When this bit is set to 1, the active width of the line is 704 pixels for the 625-line standard or 712 pixels for the 525-line standard. Currently, the BT.601 mode and BT.470 mode cannot be dynamically switched. You can change the mode only after reset. The BT.601 mode is recommended, and this mode is the default mode after power-on reset."; };
        };

